---
// Series counts printed by p10_cardinality: 1 for the route label, 10000 for
// user_id. The route bar is drawn 3 px wide so it is visible at all.
const W = 900, H = 220;
const full = 560;
---
<figure class="bep10f">
  <div class="bep10f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two horizontal bars. Labelling a counter by route gives 1 time series, a barely visible bar. Labelling it by user id gives 10000 time series, a long red bar.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>time series created by the same 10000 requests</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>số time series sinh ra từ cùng 10000 request</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="82" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>label: route</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>label: route</tspan></text>
    <rect x="200" y="66" width="3" height="22" class="bar" />
    <text x="214" y="82" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>1 series</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 series</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="142" class="nm red"><tspan data-lang-en>label: user_id</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>label: user_id</tspan></text>
    <rect x="200" y="126" width={full} height="22" class="bar red" />
    <text x="212" y="143" class="v on"><tspan data-lang-en>10000 series</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10000 series</tspan></text>
    <text x="40" y="196" class="note"><tspan data-lang-en>every distinct label value is its own series, kept in memory until the process restarts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mỗi giá trị label khác nhau là một series riêng, nằm trong bộ nhớ đến khi process restart</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Numbers from the p10_cardinality run. One label on the wrong thing turns a counter into a memory leak.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Con số lấy từ lần chạy p10_cardinality. Một label đặt sai chỗ biến counter thành rò rỉ bộ nhớ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep10f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep10f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep10f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep10f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep10f .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep10f .nm.red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep10f .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep10f .bar.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep10f .v { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep10f .v.on { fill: var(--bg); }
  .bep10f .note { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep10f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
